# Antenatal Care

Care of the pregnant woman and fetus before birth.

## Schedule

- First visit as early as possible
- Regular visits based on risk and local guidelines

## Assessments

- Blood pressure
- Weight
- Fundal height
- Fetal heart rate
- Urine protein and glucose

## Education

- Nutrition
- Danger signs
- Birth preparedness
- Breastfeeding

